msgstr "Indawo"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Indawo ebonakalayo yedivayisi.  Lo mbhalo okhululekile kungaba igumbi, indawo yerakhi, njll."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Idivayisi ye-Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Kuma-UPS asekelwe ku-SNMP, khetha idivayisi ye-Cacti ongayisebenzisela imininingwane ye-SNMP.  Ngaphandle kwalokho, khetha okuthi Lutho, futhi i-plugin ye-UPS izokwakhela idivayisi ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Zakhele ngokuzenzakalelayo eku-Poll okokuqala"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Kunikwe amandla"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Maka ukuze uqale uku-poll idatha ngokushesha."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Ulwazi lwe-APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Igama lomsingathi lomsingathi osebenzisa i-apcupsd noma iseva ye-NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Imbobo ye-TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Faka imbobo ye-TCP yale UPS.  I-apcupsd isebenzisa u-3551 ngokuzenzakalelayo kanti i-NUT isebenzisa u-3493 ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuphela (amasekhondi)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Isikhathi esingakanani i-poller elinda ngaso i-apcupsd noma iseva ye-NUT ngaphambi kokuyeka le UPS, kusukela ku-1 kuya ku-120 wamasekhondi.  Ama-UPS asekelwe ku-SNMP asebenzisa isikhathi sokuphela se-SNMP esikhundleni salokho."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Izinketho ze-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Igama le-UPS ye-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Igama le-UPS kuseva ye-NUT, njengoba kubhalwe yi-\"upsc -l\" (ingxenye ngaphambi kuka-@ ku-ups@host).  Iseva eyodwa ye-NUT ingasebenzela ama-UPS amaningana."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi le-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Akuphoqelekile.  I-akhawunti ye-upsd.users yokugunyaza ngayo.  Shiya kungenalutho ukuze uthole ukufinyelela okufundekayo kuphela okungaziwa, okuyindlela amaseva e-NUT ajwayele ukugadwa ngayo."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Iphasiwedi ye-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Iphasiwedi yegama lomsebenzisi le-NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Bethela uxhumano nge-STARTTLS ngaphambi kokuba kuthunyelwe noma yimiphi imininingwane.  Isitifiketi seseva ye-NUT negama lomsingathi kuyaqinisekiswa, ngakho-ke isitifiketi kufanele sithenjwe yi-poller ye-Cacti, noma ungakhomba kufayela layo le-CA / isitifiketi ngezansi."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Ifayela le-CA / Isitifiketi"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Akuphoqelekile.  Indlela ephelele ku-poller ye-Cacti eya kufayela le-PEM eliphethe isitifiketi se-CA (noma isitifiketi seseva esizisayinile) ukuze kuqinisekiswe iseva ye-NUT ngokumelene naso, isibonelo /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  Igama lomsingathi elingenhla kufanele lifane nesitifiketi."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Vumela Isitifiketi Esizisayinile"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Yamukela noma yisiphi isitifiketi ngaphandle kokusihlola.  Uxhumano lusabethelwe, kodwa iseva ye-NUT ayiqinisekisiwe, ngakho-ke umuntu ophakathi angafunda imininingwane ye-NUT.  Khetha Ifayela le-CA / Isitifiketi elingenhla."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Izinketho ze-SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Igama lomsingathi lapho i-ejenti ye-snmp itholakala khona."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "I-Poller ID ayikwazi ukushintshwa ngenkathi i-UPS ixhunywe kudivayisi ye-Cacti.  Shintsha i-poller kudivayisi esikhundleni salokho."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Isifanekiso se-UPS asitholakalanga! Ayikwazi ukuphinda yakhe ikhophi."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Ayikho kuma-UPS akhethiwe esenedivayisi ye-Cacti okwamanje, ngakho Ukuzenzakalela Kwegrafu akusetshenziswanga.  Idivayisi yakhiwa eku-poll okokuqala okuphumelelayo."

